~ p4_too_dark
Emily: It's so dark in here. I can't see anything. [#thought]
Emily: My string lights... if I could just get them on. [#thought]
Emily: Or I could come back when it's light out. [#thought]
=> END

~ p4_still_dark
Emily: Still too dark to look around. [#thought]
=> END

~ p4_room_reveal
Emily: Why is there... tape in my room? [#thought]
Emily: What a mess under the desk, is that... blood? [#thought]
Emily: My diary's still on the desk. [#thought]
=> END

~ p4_after
Emily: It wasn't Mom. It wasn't Dad. [#thought]
Emily: It was me. [#thought]
Emily: ...I remember now. [#thought]
Emily: The front door. I think I can finally leave. [#thought]
=> END